name: ['Ajani, Nacatl Pariah // Ajani, Nacatl Avenger', 'Basking Broodscale', 'Bloodstained Mire', 'Breaker of Creation', 'Chthonian Nightmare', 'Corrupted Shapeshifter', 'Devourer of Destiny', 'Echoes of Eternity', 'Emrakul, the World Anew', 'Flare of Cultivation', 'Flare of Denial', 'Flooded Strand', 'Forest', 'Herigast, Erupting Nullkite', 'Island', 'It That Heralds the End', 'Kappa Cannoneer', "Kozilek's Unsealing", 'Kudo, King Among Bears', 'Laelia, the Blade Reforged', 'Meltdown', 'Mountain', 'Nethergoyf', 'Null Elemental Blast', 'Nulldrifter', "Orim's Chant", 'Petrifying Meddler', 'Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd', 'Plains', 'Polluted Delta', 'Priest of Titania', 'Psychic Frog', 'Scurry of Gremlins', 'Snow-Covered Wastes', 'Spawn-Gang Commander', 'Swamp', 'Sylvan Safekeeper', "Ugin's Labyrinth", "Urza's Cave", 'Wight of the Reliquary', 'Windswept Heath', 'Winter Moon', 'Wooded Foothills', 'Writhing Chrysalis', 'Wumpus Aberration']
